"With the CHx knob in the position that gave the best performance, return to "
"the Copter Pids screen and push the \"Refresh Params\" button"
msgstr "将 CHx 旋钮保持在表现最佳的位置，返回 Copter Pids 页面并点击 「Refresh Params」 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:152
#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:156
#: d8ea48ecd6284878bf9af2ef4d276bbb f4a9f67f9e704f2eae5ca62c66761114
msgid ""
"In the Rate Roll P and Rate Pitch P fields re-type the value that you see "
"but just slightly modified so that the mission planner recognizes that it's "
"changed and resends to the autopilot (Note: if you re-type exactly the same "
"number as what appears in Rate Roll P it won't be updated).  So for example,"
" if the Rate Roll P appears as \"0.1213\" make it \"0.1200\""
msgstr ""
"在 Rate Roll P 和 Rate Pitch P 字段中，重新输入当前显示的值，但稍作修改，使 Mission Planner "
"识别到变化并重新发送给飞控（注意：如果重新输入与 Rate Roll P 中完全相同的数字，则不会更新）。例如，如果 Rate Roll P 显示为 "
"「0.1213」，则将其改为 「0.1200」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:158
#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:162
#: 83463fbe0ebd4982abf115d3ff8670ee f5520382b705453887dddae838b2ed99
msgid "Set CHx Opt back to \"None\" and push \"Write Params\""
msgstr "将 CHx Opt 设回 「None」 并点击 「Write Params」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:159
#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:163
#: 96abe6b896d84da3837a7890f24e7ed2 cca7a192e5c249f6a39b9ea29cdda0a4
msgid "Push the Disconnect button on the top right, and the Connect"
msgstr "点击右上角的 Disconnect 按钮，然后点击 Connect"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:160
#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:164
#: 246508e6fe7c46f3865281629200380d afc7c2a3f481436d8f00b3244a33ad78
msgid ""
"Ensure that the Rate Roll P value is the value that you retyped in step #13"
msgstr "确认 Rate Roll P 的值是您在第 13 步中重新输入的值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:163
#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:167
#: c308f31fedfb47c983237ccb338505c5 c8c9979b6b664af3bc0a04ba5db15733
msgid ""
"While you are moving the tuning knob the values update at 3 times per "
"second.  The need to press the Refresh button in the mission planner in "
"steps #7 and #8 above is just because the Copter is not sending the updates "
"to the mission planner in real-time."
msgstr ""
"移动调参旋钮时，数值每秒更新 3 次。上述第 7 步和第 8 步需要按 Refresh 按钮，是因为飞机不会实时将更新发送给 Mission "
"Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:24
#: 6ec23f31fde74f3191a0b40e00e48517 80e6ef8dc5ce4876bd6105e1fbd1f79d
msgid "Key features of transmitter based tuning are:"
msgstr "基于遥控器的调参主要特性："

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:26
#: 1c3629c3cd8a427494f4d332d8923c50 87252dc6129143b0b6185192ba9cae5d
msgid ""
"Tune either a single parameter or a whole set of related parameters in a "
"single flight"
msgstr "在单次飞行中调整单个参数或一整组相关参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:29
#: 036675261ac342a9b1118b14ebfac17d 136ceb2f052344c59d491913c8f99ed0
msgid ""
"Re-scale the range of the parameter value linked to the tuning knob using a "
"\"selector switch\""
msgstr "使用「选择开关」重新调整调参旋钮对应的参数值范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:32
#: 39b6cf84159645fe8d93a26081eed7b1 9290fb660c814ac0a8d83e82bd6e2dcc
msgid "Switch between parameters to tune while flying using a selector switch"
msgstr "飞行中通过选择开关切换要调整的参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:35
#: 87fcbd6b19ed477fbb9e0c2a326ea707 a27795ecd9494fd293dca3566440e4d6
msgid "Save the new parameters in flight"
msgstr "在飞行中保存新参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:37
#: 8ec88b44abd64c04b4a219d47cfe0c18 bc3d0cd7eccd4a3fbe9f518ac2e363a9
msgid ""
"Receive audible feedback from the flight board buzzer and the GCS on tuning "
"progress"
msgstr "通过飞控蜂鸣器和地面站接收调参进度的声音反馈"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:42
#: 81c800a59452497fba566dda515f3147 c776cc0d5e044020814c3eab3274cc1c
msgid "Concepts"
msgstr "概念"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:44
#: 729b86e1717d46d4b6b11b48b7ed8476 8bef4aa5013243dd97b11929a26b6b2b
msgid "The two key controls for transmitter based tuning are:"
msgstr "基于遥控器的调参有两个关键控制："

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:46
#: 8413aa0abd8741fabdf81c60dd656d44 a107a17bd941478bb88dd5fe318fbccb
msgid ""
"A \"tuning knob\", setup on your transmitter to a convenient knob or slider "
"and linked to an RC channel that your board receives"
msgstr "「调参旋钮」，在遥控器上将其设置为方便的旋钮或滑块，并链接到飞控接收的 RC 通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:49
#: 9ea8405ee1bf43e7b37240f4f83c96b9 c4cc02009d894631ba0dfe5351de6bea
msgid ""
"An optional \"selector switch\" for controlling advanced features of the "
"tune. This should be linked to a two position switch mapped to a RC channel "
"that your board receives. A spring loaded switch (such as the trainer "
"switch) works particularly well."
msgstr "可选的「选择开关」，用于控制调参的高级功能。应链接到飞控接收的 RC 通道的双位置开关。带弹簧复位的开关（如教练开关）效果尤佳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:54
#: 10bd7e25200c4967a211b822a447c0fd 8686d58531cd457b82fdae2d9ae155ad
msgid ""
"In addition to those input controls the following concepts are useful in "
"understanding the tuning process:"
msgstr "除上述输入控件外，以下概念有助于理解调参过程："

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:57
#: 3e0343359b8048ef81bfffd9d8ee1a4d 7ab4c5dfd1ec4f52809219d162dc0c5d
msgid ""
"A \"parameter set\" is a group of related parameters that can be tuned one "
"after the other in a single flight"
msgstr "「参数集」是一组相关参数，可在单次飞行中依次调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:60
#: 3e095ac668ae4f4c83613f162e88115f b320ee5e812f47db97e37044336c237f
msgid ""
"The \"mid-point\" is point on the tuning knobs range where it produces a PWM"
" value half way between minimum and maximum"
msgstr "「中点」是调参旋钮范围内产生最小值和最大值之间中间 PWM 值的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:65
#: b5f5e0165f0b4aed8ebd1841ba041a80 fc907b3ce716499dbdb3b200b49333fe
msgid "Setting up for tuning"
msgstr "调参配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:67
#: 989fde163bb94c60852a53b30f5cc092 ff8086e181ff4d24aaa0d3ee8c2e492f
msgid ""
"To setup your vehicle for tuning you need to set the following parameters:"
msgstr "要为飞机配置调参，需要设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:70
#: 52b1788fdf15430aa94ac2ce4da35221 af0327c7d804483a9f83755c8e3fccbf
msgid ""
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>`: the RC input channel associated with your "
"chosen tuning knob"
msgstr ":ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>`：与所选调参旋钮关联的 RC 输入通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:72
#: ae32fa3069374899b3ad363506064f24 c3590bb052624bf984f969f9bb032d29
msgid ""
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MIN<TUNE_CHAN_MIN>`: the minimum PWM values produced on "
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MIN<TUNE_CHAN_MIN>`：:ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>` 上产生的最小 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:73
#: c47913f5ac034a34af5cf2e861e70f75 f413080606964d0cbecf21cd4d6fd5ac
msgid ""
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MAX<TUNE_CHAN_MAX>`: the maximum PWM values produced on "
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MAX<TUNE_CHAN_MAX>`：:ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>` 上产生的最大 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:74
#: 14e5d860c8fe4dca894ead880d8124c0 baad12a072f94e4f95cf2f443e98b169
msgid ""
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>`: the parameter or set of parameters you will "
"be tuning"
msgstr ":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>`：你将要调参的参数或参数集"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:75
#: 7fe68ce9932a4b53a74190cdbb7ef4df 9dadeb8b6853424cbf0e6129c0011be7
msgid ""
":ref:`TUNE_SELECTOR<TUNE_SELECTOR>`: the RC input channel associated with "
"your chosen selector switch (optional)"
msgstr ":ref:`TUNE_SELECTOR<TUNE_SELECTOR>`：与所选选择开关关联的 RC 输入通道（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:77
#: 03591e7745504e378dbeceb0b3bd4701 2ec5ff6962504fbea39b520acf8974c2
msgid ""
":ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>`: the scaling range which the tuning knob "
"covers"
msgstr ":ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>`：调参旋钮覆盖的缩放范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:79
#: 25916124f6614671b19a9f4dd3e26085 9b98fc0e34414399885ff1763a6032eb
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` parameter selects the parameter or set of "
"parameters you will be tuning. Values of :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` less "
"than 100 correspond to individual tunable parameters whereas values of 101 "
"or higher correspond to sets of related parameters that can be tuned one "
"after the other in a flight."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 参数用于选择将要调整的参数或参数集。小于 100 的 "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 值对应单个可调参数，而 101 及以上的值对应可在单次飞行中依次调整的相关参数集。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:85
#: 7fe526c6d94647bb9589251e9e9e169a
msgid ""
"Most of the tuneable parameters apply to the VTOL operation of QuadPlanes. "
"Only :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` values in the 50-57 range are for fixed "
"wing operation."
msgstr ""
"大多数可调参数适用于 QuadPlane 的 VTOL 操作。只有 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 值在 50-57 "
"范围内的参数适用于固定翼操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:87
#: 4451042d323c4c96bd4b11c2e0c45abe 8791c9d3539b4e1fa71b07b5bcd81dfd
msgid ""
"Use your ground stations parameter interface to see see the full list of "
"tunable parameters and parameter sets available for "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>`. For Plane most of the parameters are "
"associated with tuning the QuadPlane VTOL motors as those are the most "
"difficult to tune. You can also tune some fixed wing parameters, although "
"most people find the automatic tuning with AUTOTUNE mode is the best option "
"for fixed wing flight."
msgstr ""
"使用地面站的参数界面查看 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 的全部可调参数和参数集列表。对于 Plane，大多数参数与 "
"QuadPlane VTOL 电机调参相关，因为这些是最难调的。也可以调整一些固定翼参数，不过大多数人认为 AUTOTUNE "
"模式的自动调参是固定翼飞行的最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:95
#: 5338f7a9a8ca46b4b5d0312134c82164 8e25660091f745089cf233026772cea4
msgid ""
"If you want to tune a set of parameters (by choosing a "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` value over 100) you must have a selector "
"switch configured with the :ref:`TUNE_SELECTOR<TUNE_SELECTOR>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"如果要调整一组参数（通过选择大于 100 的 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 值），必须通过 "
":ref:`TUNE_SELECTOR<TUNE_SELECTOR>` 参数配置选择开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:100
#: 2eb9357328d344b49703af73fb03fe65 e20ab20e028946cca12712445597e44d
msgid "Using the tuning knob"
msgstr "使用调参旋钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:102
#: 395a56b622e74c89980795b590a6f9e2 5741fcffae47441d8544ccc48553be79
msgid ""
"The basic operation of the tuning knob is very simple. If the tuning knob is"
" at the bottom of its range then the parameter being tuned is set to the "
"initial value divided by the :ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>`. If the tuning "
"knob is at the top of its range then the parameter being tuned will be set "
"to the initial value multiplied by :ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>`."
msgstr ""
"调参旋钮的基本操作非常简单。若调参旋钮处于行程最低位，则被调参数将设为初始值除以 "
":ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>`。若调参旋钮处于行程最高位，则被调参数将设为初始值乘以 "
":ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:108
#: 7e066e03cd594dca83d7dc4ab3280241 812df3d22606457c8ff830996b1cc1df
msgid ""
"So with a default value for :ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>` of 2 you will be "
"able to change the parameter in a range from half its initial value to 2x "
"the initial value. This is a good range for many tuning tasks."
msgstr ""
"因此，当 :ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>` 的默认值为 2 时，您可以在初始值的一半到初始值的 2 "
"倍之间调整参数。这对于许多调参任务来说是一个合适的范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:113
#: 46af672302c24db49625f721eb685f26 dbcad60fcbde4baf959cb4fc5f566ef7
msgid "Activating the tuning knob"
msgstr "激活调参旋钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:115
#: a63d16d6f5f5434eb261e54ddd2990a4 aca6fc961118423dafff3fabe5fc0b5c
msgid ""
"When you first start tuning a parameter you will find the tuning knob is not"
" yet active. This is because the knob does not activate until it passes the "
"\"mid-point value\", defined as half way between "
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MIN<TUNE_CHAN_MIN>` and :ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MAX<TUNE_CHAN_MAX>`."
" Activating the tuning knob in this way ensures that you don't accidentally "
"take off with a large change in tuning value. You are guaranteed to start "
"the tune with a value very close to your current value for the parameter."
msgstr ""
"当您首次开始调参时，会发现调参旋钮尚未激活。这是因为旋钮需要经过「中间值」才会激活，即 "
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MIN<TUNE_CHAN_MIN>` 与 :ref:`TUNE_CHAN_MAX<TUNE_CHAN_MAX>` "
"之间的中点。以这种方式激活调参旋钮可确保您不会因调参值的大幅变化而意外起飞。系统保证您从非常接近当前参数值的位置开始调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:123
#: 16e12770e8f345d691bef28e88547c50 583e928e515346f696000164a8b226d5
msgid ""
"When the tuning knob activates by reaching the mid-point the buzzer on the "
"flight board will give a quick \"bup-bip\" sound to indicate that tuning has"
" been activated."
msgstr "当调参旋钮通过中间值激活时，飞控板上的蜂鸣器会发出快速的「滴嘟」声，表示调参已激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:128
#: 1a884ad930cf4aff90811063f6258590 ea27b0b6177546e7b34873fa65474956
msgid "Re-centering the tuning knob"
msgstr "重新居中调参旋钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:130
#: 7784c9a40bb5428db3c2beddcd4c4697 e7ba1a36e4204701b8f90e0184699070
msgid ""
"It is quite common to find that the :ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>` is not "
"wide enough to move the tuning value to the ideal point for your vehicle. "
"For example, you may have started the tune with a P gain for some axis of "
"0.7, and when you move the tuning knob up all the way the vehicle still "
"hasn't started oscillating. In that case the tuning value will have reached "
"1.4 and you need some more range."
msgstr ""
"通常会发现 :ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>` 不够宽，无法将调参值调整到飞行器的理想点。例如，您可能以某轴 P 增益 0.7 "
"开始调参，但将调参旋钮转到最高位时飞行器仍未开始振荡。此时调参值已达到 1.4，您需要更大的范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:137
#: 710b6130e9b14051809f8a6fcd85eb30 b301973d0d1143fc92345a4c09d861e8
msgid ""
"To get more range you can use the selector switch to re-center the tuning "
"knob around the current value. Toggle the selector switch briefly high then "
"low and the center-value will change to whatever the tubing knob is set to. "
"When you re-center the tuning knob will de-activate again until you move it "
"to the mid-point position. This prevents you from getting a jump in the "
"tuning value when you re-center."
msgstr ""
"要获得更大范围，可使用选择开关将调参旋钮重新居中于当前值。短暂地将选择开关拨高后再拨低，中心值将变为调参旋钮当前所设定的值。重新居中后，调参旋钮将再次停用，直到您将其移至中间位置。这可防止重新居中时调参值发生跳变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:145
#: 52e038a10f2840c9a7e70c2099989e9b a3bccc0c39374de6964439579a5d4ed9
msgid "Tuning multiple parameters"
msgstr "调整多个参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:147
#: 8449aade042944a58383be23e7ef50ef e0d1d7aa30b74c3faac609d12bfcc00b
msgid ""
"You can tune multiple parameters in one flight by setting "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` to one of the \"tuning set\" parameters. For "
"example, if you set :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` to 101 then you will have "
"4 different stages to your tune:"
msgstr ""
"您可以通过将 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 设置为某个「调参集」参数，在一次飞行中调整多个参数。例如，若将 "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` 设为 101，则调参将分为 4 个阶段："

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:151
#: ad6e54eb28e641588c08e3674be1c54d aef03850cb0a464a9fb09900c7ecd0bb
msgid "``Roll: Rate D``"
msgstr "``Roll: Rate D``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:152
#: 78f6ecae14e045a09a74a75873dbb5c0 c1b5c15537f44848b7f7488aeeca4b9e
msgid "``Roll: Rate P and Rate I``"
msgstr "``Roll: Rate P and Rate I``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:153
#: 52babc9fe4ef4f49bf26088740b768cc cb3cefb3e9434593839e8440a192cd93
msgid "``Pitch: Rate D``"
msgstr "``Pitch: Rate D``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:154
#: 95100ef9db884ebaabd2aeaad27487ed a54272c2dfa04254bfaf58b0e4a56101
msgid "``Pitch: Rate P and Rate I``"
msgstr "``Pitch: Rate P and Rate I``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:156
#: 043c3c1df04246dba4ab0dbb23ce5892 d340ba7950784ce1823ab233ded379c7
msgid ""
"notice that ``Roll: Rate P and Rate I`` is actually two parameters in one, "
"controlling both the P gain and the I gain for roll. This follows the normal"
" advice for MultiCopters that you should keep the P and I values equal when "
"doing a manual tune."
msgstr ""
"请注意，``Roll: Rate P and Rate I`` 实际上是一个包含两个参数的组合，同时控制横滚的 P 增益和 I "
"增益。这遵循了多旋翼飞行器手动调参时应保持 P 和 I 值相等的通用建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:161
#: a0e39af90e95429782aea27ceb13b6d0 f6feffd714a24de29cfffba1db58883a
msgid ""
"When you choose a tuning set with :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` then you "
"will initially be tuning the first parameter in the set. Once you have "
"adjusted that parameter as much as you need to you can move to the next "
"parameter in the set by holding the selector switch for more than 2 seconds."
" It is suggested that you count to 3 to ensure you are over 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"当您通过 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` "
"选择调参集后，最初将调整集合中的第一个参数。调整完该参数后，可通过持续按住选择开关超过 2 秒来切换到集合中的下一个参数。建议数到 3，以确保超过 2 "
"秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:167
#: 12798df8c8244956b14baeb95765f462 5f75c233eb814a3eba26c3a54bd3864f
msgid ""
"Holding the selector switch for more than 2 seconds will switch you to the "
"next parameter and will also change the tuning knob back to its \"wait for "
"mid-point\" state on the new parameter. The buzzer on the board will give a "
"loud BEEP sequence to indicate which parameter in the set you have changed "
"to. For the first parameter in the set, you will get one loud BEEP. For the "
"second parameter, you will get two loud BEEPs and so on."
msgstr ""
"持续按住选择开关超过 2 秒将切换到下一个参数，并将调参旋钮恢复到新参数的「等待中间值」状态。飞控板蜂鸣器将发出响亮的 BEEP "
"声序列，提示您已切换到集合中的哪个参数。对于集合中的第一个参数，将发出一次响亮的 BEEP 声；对于第二个参数，将发出两次，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:175
#: c410143720ef4655a36ce7db0e2ac8a7 f4bd6ddd1c7848ebad977e7be632809f
msgid ""
"When you have cycled through all of the parameters in the tuning set you "
"have chosen it will wrap back around to the first parameter in the set."
msgstr "当您循环遍历所选调参集中的所有参数后，将重新回到集合中的第一个参数。"

